  "interpretation": "<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" data-cke-table-faked-selection-table=\"\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Concentration of IgG in IU/ml</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Class</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Level of The specific IgG</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">&lt;1.0</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">0</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Cilinically insignificant</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">1.0 - 2.0</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">0-1</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Low</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">&gt; 2.0 - 3.5</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">1</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Medium</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">&gt; 3.5</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">&gt;1</span></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">High</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Results need to be coorelated clinically.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">Food intolerance is IgG mediated hypersensitivity, so called Type II and Typer III reaction. &nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><span st